      "EpisodeMasterId": 130821,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『啊……插句话抱歉。那个……有个Cosplay活动，要办哦？/n天气也暖起来了，感觉正适合Cosplay……』",
      "VoiceFileName": "1308210370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130821049,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130821,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "想Cosplay的是伊吕波和美兔。/n我不想。也就是说，跟我没关系。那么——。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1308210380",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 78,
